  "description": "The user is projected onto the overall memorial scene, which includes the woman standing beside the portrait of Trayvon Martin and the overlaid text 'r.i.p. trayvon martin'. The scene functions as a collective memorial space, inviting the user to participate in the commemoration and reflection on racial injustice. The woman’s solemn presence and the portrait serve as anchors for the user’s emotional and symbolic engagement with the memorial context.",
